@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Scan a local image (set imagePath in your HTTP client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scan
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=EcoScanBoundary

--EcoScanBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="plastic-bottle.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\images\plastic-bottle.jpg
--EcoScanBoundary--

### Demo list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo

### Demo result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/plastic-bottle

### Unknown demo identifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/unknown

### Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Bad file type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scan
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=EcoScanBadFile

--EcoScanBadFile
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not an image.
--EcoScanBadFile--
